00:17:57.960 --> 00:17:59.300
Look at that!

00:17:59.600 --> 00:18:01.660
Lil' Tim Tim, here you go!

00:18:01.660 --> 00:18:04.380
Bing-bong-a-ding-dong, have a good day!

00:18:04.380 --> 00:18:07.500
Mark: Hold my haaaand.
Employee: Hey boss, that party left a huge pile of dirty dishes.

00:18:07.740 --> 00:18:09.680
Employee: We're gonna need your help to get through these.

00:18:09.920 --> 00:18:13.280
Mark: I'm the boss?
Employee: They're pretty nasty, so make sure you use a good squirt of soap.

00:18:13.520 --> 00:18:14.580
I'm the boss?

00:18:14.820 --> 00:18:16.100
I'M the boss??

00:18:16.260 --> 00:18:18.620
Someone didn't tell me that I was the boss here!

00:18:18.620 --> 00:18:21.460
And if I'm the boss, why am I doing dishes!?

00:18:21.660 --> 00:18:23.300
IS THIS FUN YET?

00:18:23.300 --> 00:18:24.780
God, this is so realistic!

00:18:24.900 --> 00:18:26.720
I'm almost as bored as I could be!

00:18:27.280 --> 00:18:30.200
[Wordless singing]

00:18:30.200 --> 00:18:34.000
[Singing while waving hands around in mid-air]

00:18:34.000 --> 00:18:36.980
[Imagine Mark singing while doing his dishes.]

00:18:36.980 --> 00:18:38.960
[Things taken out of context are weirdly funny.]

00:18:38.960 --> 00:18:39.660
What if I just-

00:18:40.220 --> 00:18:40.720
Eh.

00:18:41.060 --> 00:18:41.560
Eh.

00:18:41.900 --> 00:18:42.460
Oh.

00:18:42.640 --> 00:18:43.860
I am skilled.

00:18:44.140 --> 00:18:45.900
Mark: Hap! Hap!
Employee: Great! Thanks for your help!

00:18:46.120 --> 00:18:48.940
I'm gonna assume that that went exactly as I imagined it did not,

00:18:48.940 --> 00:18:51.440
because the programming assisted my own stupidity.

00:18:51.620 --> 00:18:52.960
Because I don't need...

00:18:52.960 --> 00:18:55.380
[Awkward pause in attempts to be cool]

00:18:55.380 --> 00:18:58.840
I don't need- That was supposed to be much smoother, but take it as being-

00:18:58.840 --> 00:19:02.420
Chef: I need your help! The health inspector's on his way over and

00:19:02.420 --> 00:19:04.580
Chef: I don't think we're gonna pass inspection!

00:19:04.920 --> 00:19:06.660
Mark: Okay.
Chef: We need to clean this place up!

00:19:06.980 --> 00:19:09.000
Chef: And make it safe! And sanitary!

00:19:09.480 --> 00:19:13.340
Chef: And you can start by destroying all these old fruit! Ugh!

00:19:14.380 --> 00:19:17.500
Uhh, okay I only have two hands! Why'd you hand me the box?

00:19:18.000 --> 00:19:19.940
Where am I supposed to do it? Can I blend it up?

00:19:20.120 --> 00:19:20.620
Can you get th-

00:19:21.060 --> 00:19:23.280
Oh, god. Can you get that box outta my face?

00:19:23.280 --> 00:19:24.580
What're you supposed to do?

00:19:25.120 --> 00:19:26.660
Not toast it, apparently.

00:19:26.660 --> 00:19:27.520
[Machine clanking]

00:19:27.520 --> 00:19:28.060
Uh...

00:19:28.960 --> 00:19:29.580
Habadoop!

00:19:30.220 --> 00:19:31.460
Let's see. Hey!

00:19:31.960 --> 00:19:34.740
Out with the old, in with the good!

00:19:34.740 --> 00:19:37.120
Job Bot: Okay, that's one thing taken care of. How 'bout those sprinklers?

00:19:37.120 --> 00:19:38.680
Job Bot: See that little thing up on the ceiling?

00:19:38.740 --> 00:19:40.300
Mark: AHH!
Job Bot: Try chucking something at it.

00:19:40.300 --> 00:19:41.280
Mark: Ah!
Job Bot: See what happens.

00:19:41.280 --> 00:19:43.140
Ah, shit! Ah, goddammit dude!

00:19:43.140 --> 00:19:43.740
Ahh!

00:19:44.180 --> 00:19:47.120
Job Bot: I... guess it's not working! Oh well-
Mark: AHH!

00:19:47.120 --> 00:19:49.220
Job Bot: what are the chances of there being a fire in here anyway?

00:19:49.500 --> 00:19:52.980
Mark: AAH!
Job Bot: We'll only need to deal with any potential insect problems.

00:19:52.980 --> 00:19:54.840
Job Bot: Look around and see if you can find anything.

00:19:55.700 --> 00:19:56.320
UM.

00:19:57.040 --> 00:19:58.680
'Please Don't Spit In Food'.

00:19:58.680 --> 00:20:00.920
Aww, man. I wish I'd read that earlier.

00:20:01.140 --> 00:20:01.940
Well, we're-

00:20:01.940 --> 00:20:03.280
[Manly screaming]

00:20:04.380 --> 00:20:07.320
[Manly screaming complete with manly arm-flailing]

00:20:07.320 --> 00:20:08.960
Job Bot: Yikes! That's not good!
Mark: AHH!

00:20:09.220 --> 00:20:11.000
Job Bot: You need to do something about these guys!

00:20:11.000 --> 00:20:12.140
Job Bot: Get rid of them, quick!
Mark: *sounds of disgust*

00:20:13.000 --> 00:20:14.800
What do I d- eegh... beh.

00:20:15.520 --> 00:20:16.020
[chuckle]

00:20:16.360 --> 00:20:16.860
Eeh...

00:20:17.900 --> 00:20:18.480
Guhh.

00:20:18.480 --> 00:20:19.540
hadeBEDEH!

00:20:20.180 --> 00:20:20.780
guhh~

00:20:21.520 --> 00:20:22.140
[shrieks]

00:20:22.700 --> 00:20:24.380
Mark: Okay, they're all dead, I hope!
Job Bot: Well, I guess that'll have to do.

00:20:24.500 --> 00:20:25.820
Job Bot: Here comes the health inspector.

00:20:25.920 --> 00:20:27.700
Mark: YUOH HEY!
Inspector: Okay,

00:20:27.700 --> 00:20:30.380
Inspector: everybody stop what you're doing.

00:20:30.380 --> 00:20:31.900
Inspector: It's inspection time.
Mark: Oh!

00:20:31.900 --> 00:20:32.600
Hi!

00:20:33.160 --> 00:20:34.580
Hey cutie! How're you doin'?

00:20:34.580 --> 00:20:36.580
Inspector: Hmm. Yes. Interesting.

00:20:36.840 --> 00:20:38.100
[Mocking] Hmm. Yes.

00:20:38.540 --> 00:20:40.800
Inspector: Hmmph. It's questionable.
Mark: [mocking] Mmmeh.

00:20:41.040 --> 00:20:42.860
MMMPH. MMMERPH

00:20:43.020 --> 00:20:46.480
Inspector: Hmm... Alright then. I'll just tally these results.

00:20:46.480 --> 00:20:50.220
[Dial-up sounds]

00:20:50.220 --> 00:20:52.480
Inspector: And it looks like you've passed.

00:20:52.480 --> 00:20:53.480
Mark: YEAH!
Inspector: This time.

00:20:53.940 --> 00:20:54.480
Okay.

00:20:55.160 --> 00:20:58.840
Good enough. You want some slop? We've got plenty of high-quality slop here.

00:20:58.840 --> 00:21:00.460
Job Bot: Phew! That was a close one.
Mark: Fresh outta the blender.

00:21:00.600 --> 00:21:02.460
Job Bot: But now we can get back to business.

00:21:02.600 --> 00:21:03.960
Oh boy, I can't wait.

00:21:03.960 --> 00:21:04.460
Euyck!

00:21:04.800 --> 00:21:06.700
HEY! I- I was like ten for ten.

00:21:06.700 --> 00:21:09.680
Chef: Hey chef! There's a bot here to film an episode of some-
Mark: There's a BOMB?

00:21:09.680 --> 00:21:11.320
Chef: -TV show with you?
Mark: Oh.

00:21:12.160 --> 00:21:14.540
Chef: Well, they say it was already booked ahead of time, so...

00:21:15.140 --> 00:21:17.300
Chef: Well... just do whatever they say.

00:21:18.100 --> 00:21:21.120
Okay! But this is a simulation, you know that right?

00:21:21.120 --> 00:21:23.000
It's not real- who the hell are you?
TV Bot: Hey! It's Human!

00:21:23.000 --> 00:21:27.820
TV Bot: I'm TV Bot! We're doing a show on how these organic nutrient packs are made!

00:21:27.820 --> 00:21:31.640
Mark: How're doin'?
TV Bot: So I just need to record some footage of you going through the various steps. K?

00:21:31.980 --> 00:21:32.740
Okay!

00:21:32.900 --> 00:21:36.360
Mark: What about-
TV Bot: First step is to blend up this protein pill!

00:21:36.360 --> 00:21:37.740
TV Bot: Let's get a shot of you doing that.

00:21:38.020 --> 00:21:42.940
Okay, we got some fresh bug juice here, don't mind my not-being able to pronounce words correctly!

00:21:42.940 --> 00:21:44.940
Mark: Fresh bug juice for everybody.
TV Bot: Hey hey hey! Okay!

00:21:44.940 --> 00:21:48.880
TV Bot: That was good! Now, let's get a shot of you putting this flavor packet in the microwave!

00:21:49.020 --> 00:21:50.020
Okay!

00:21:50.300 --> 00:21:52.520
Is this for ramen? I love ramen!

00:21:52.640 --> 00:21:54.340
But I dunno what this gonna do!

00:21:54.340 --> 00:21:56.440
TV Bot: Alriiiiight! It's in there!
[Buggy clanking]

00:21:56.440 --> 00:21:59.620
TV Bot: Close the door and let me get a shot of the microwave a-runnin'.

00:21:59.880 --> 00:22:01.260
The-There you go, buddy!

00:22:01.260 --> 00:22:03.100
Mark: I mean, if that's what gets you off.
TV Bot: Alright!

00:22:03.100 --> 00:22:05.640
TV Bot: Everybody's followin' along at home, we got our-
[CHOMP]

00:22:05.640 --> 00:22:07.480
TV Bot: - fully-expanded flavor cube.
Mark: Eugh! EUGH!

00:22:07.480 --> 00:22:09.060
TV Bot: Can you just show that to the camera?

00:22:09.060 --> 00:22:09.640
EUGH!

00:22:10.040 --> 00:22:11.320
AUGH! I ATE IT!

00:22:11.520 --> 00:22:12.020
[nom]

00:22:12.020 --> 00:22:13.500
I- I JUST LITERALLY TOOK A BITE!

00:22:13.500 --> 00:22:14.500
IS THIS GONNA KILL ME?

00:22:14.500 --> 00:22:18.020
TV Bot: -pour that blended protein fluid onto the cube and we-

00:22:18.020 --> 00:22:18.640
Mark: Oh.
TV Bot: - are done!

00:22:19.180 --> 00:22:19.680
Oh.

00:22:20.300 --> 00:22:20.860
Thank you!

00:22:22.800 --> 00:22:23.480
Why?

00:22:23.480 --> 00:22:25.320
Mark: Why am I doing this?
TV Bot: Hey! Great job, human!

00:22:25.320 --> 00:22:26.440
TV Bot: Really appreciate it.

00:22:26.440 --> 00:22:29.140
TV Bot: Ooh! One more thing: Can I get a shot of you eating it?
Mark: Okay...

00:22:29.140 --> 00:22:31.820
Mark: EEEEH!
TV Bot: Just [???] delicious, huhhh?

00:22:31.820 --> 00:22:34.400
I-I just did that! Why do I gotta do it again?

00:22:34.580 --> 00:22:37.540
I don't wanna eat more! I already feel like my intestines are melting away!

00:22:37.540 --> 00:22:39.020
Alright, here we go. [Nomnomnom]

00:22:39.020 --> 00:22:40.160
Ahh, flavor!

00:22:40.160 --> 00:22:41.560
Mark: Full of flavor!
TV Bot: Thank you so much, human!

00:22:41.560 --> 00:22:45.620
Mark: ALL of the flavor!
TV Bot: -footage, this episode's gonna be fanTAStic!

00:22:45.760 --> 00:22:46.880
Okay, whatever you say!

00:22:46.880 --> 00:22:48.880
Mark: Hello~
Customer: Hey human, check this out!

00:22:48.880 --> 00:22:52.340
Customer: I found this rare Turbo Ghostav Nova Pepper.

00:22:52.580 --> 00:22:56.860
Customer: Can you it for me? I like it H O T. Hawt!

00:22:57.120 --> 00:22:58.860
Mark: Well jus- 
Customer: Come on! Put some heat into it!

00:22:58.860 --> 00:22:59.920
Just EAT it, then!

00:23:00.180 --> 00:23:03.080
Ohh, you don't understand 'cause you're a ROBOT!

00:23:03.180 --> 00:23:05.840
Mark: It's so hot it's spasming all over the place.
Customer: Come on, that's not hot enough!

00:23:05.840 --> 00:23:07.220
Mark: Also screaming in pain.
Customer: Can't you do something else?

00:23:07.680 --> 00:23:08.180
Ah.

00:23:08.620 --> 00:23:09.120
Ah!

00:23:09.580 --> 00:23:10.080
Ah!

00:23:10.620 --> 00:23:11.120
Ahah!

00:23:11.480 --> 00:23:12.080
AH!

00:23:12.080 --> 00:23:13.760
How 'bout some microwahvuh?

00:23:14.520 --> 00:23:15.240
[Clank] Goink!

00:23:15.880 --> 00:23:17.280
This will be the one for you!

00:23:17.280 --> 00:23:18.700
There you go! Have fun!

00:23:19.440 --> 00:23:21.740
Don't die! If you even CAN die.

00:23:22.200 --> 00:23:23.560
Which I don't think you can.

00:23:23.560 --> 00:23:27.280
Employee: Hey chef, we got bots out here who ordered the 'special'.

00:23:27.380 --> 00:23:30.140
Employee: Not sure what that means, but that's what they want.

00:23:30.140 --> 00:23:33.060
Job Bot: Ordering the 'special' means placing your trust in the chef.

00:23:33.280 --> 00:23:35.920
Job Bot: Just give those bots anything! Be creative.

00:23:36.820 --> 00:23:40.700
I'm going to be exactly un-creative, because I'm gonna put...

00:23:40.980 --> 00:23:43.420
sriracha on a potato,

00:23:43.720 --> 00:23:45.480
and then hope for the best. Boink!

00:23:45.480 --> 00:23:47.480
Job Bot: Hmm... that looks 'INTERESTING'.

00:23:47.480 --> 00:23:48.960
Mark: Okay!
Job Bot: Send it off to the customer.

00:23:48.960 --> 00:23:50.120
Customer: Ohohohoho!
Mark: How 'bout-

00:23:50.120 --> 00:23:52.000
Customer: What a fascinating dish!
Mark: How 'bout a-

00:23:52.500 --> 00:23:54.300
How 'bout a corn cob sandwich?

00:23:54.920 --> 00:23:56.360
That's always everybody's favorite!

00:23:56.640 --> 00:23:58.120
Boink! Add a little garnish,

00:23:58.480 --> 00:24:00.480
[Stuttering]

00:24:00.480 --> 00:24:02.920
It's blocked by the corn! The corn's too thick!

00:24:03.160 --> 00:24:04.620
A little garnish, and there we go!

00:24:04.820 --> 00:24:06.940
Mark: Eeh, boink!
Job Bot: Another beautiful-looking meal, chef!

00:24:06.940 --> 00:24:07.580
Mark: I dunno!

00:24:07.580 --> 00:24:11.760
Customer: [???] -A special!

00:24:12.100 --> 00:24:16.180
*sniff* Uh, you got it, officer! Anything for an officer of the law!

00:24:16.180 --> 00:24:17.740
How 'bout an irradiated cactus?

00:24:17.740 --> 00:24:19.020
Job Bot: And that'll do for the last one.

00:24:19.600 --> 00:24:22.280
Alright, you're welcome there, buddy! Hope you're having a good day!

00:24:22.280 --> 00:24:24.280
He's probably very depressed about something going on in his life.

00:24:24.280 --> 00:24:27.200
Customer: Holy smokes! This is waaaaay too hot!

00:24:27.400 --> 00:24:28.080
[Screeching]

00:24:28.500 --> 00:24:31.480
Job Bot: Oh, sounds like the bot with the hot pepper from earlier.
Mark: I got you, buddy! Shit.

00:24:31.480 --> 00:24:34.140
Customer: Help a bot out here! Come ooon!

00:24:34.800 --> 00:24:35.300
Ehh!

00:24:35.820 --> 00:24:37.020
Well, that didn't do nothin'!

00:24:37.020 --> 00:24:38.720
Ohh, everything's on fire!

00:24:38.820 --> 00:24:40.200
Why is everything on fire?

00:24:40.420 --> 00:24:41.040
AHH!

00:24:41.560 --> 00:24:42.240
I'm trying to-

00:24:42.640 --> 00:24:43.140
Egh

00:24:43.480 --> 00:24:43.980
How do I-

00:24:44.520 --> 00:24:45.100
I'm trying t-

00:24:45.500 --> 00:24:46.040
Guh!

00:24:46.520 --> 00:24:47.680
I did my best!

00:24:48.140 --> 00:24:49.900
What am I- What I doing wrong!?

00:24:50.580 --> 00:24:52.480
Oh, god. What am I doing wrong?

00:24:52.480 --> 00:24:54.560
What do I dooo?

00:24:55.120 --> 00:24:55.700
Oh, do I-

00:24:55.700 --> 00:24:56.200
[psssssh]

00:24:56.200 --> 00:24:58.940
OHHH. THAT makes sense!

00:24:58.940 --> 00:25:01.320
Customer: WHOO! Thanks, human! You really saved my circuits!

00:25:01.520 --> 00:25:02.060
Ahhh.

00:25:03.160 --> 00:25:05.920
You're welcome, buddy! I don't know what you said, but you're welcome.

00:25:05.920 --> 00:25:10.540
Chef: I just got word from the TV studio, human. They like their performance on there!

00:25:10.540 --> 00:25:12.980
Mark: Yay!
Chef: - you did, so they're sending in a camera crew!

00:25:12.980 --> 00:25:15.100
Chef: They're gonna put you in a reality show!

00:25:15.300 --> 00:25:16.100
WHOO!

00:25:16.300 --> 00:25:18.300
Mark: YEAH!
Job Bot: In the distant past, having your own-

00:25:18.300 --> 00:25:21.020
Mark: I'm gonna be on TV!
Job Bot: -seen as the peak of human achievement.

00:25:21.340 --> 00:25:22.380
Job Bot: Good work, human!
Mark: Oh.

00:25:22.620 --> 00:25:23.320
YAY!

00:25:24.180 --> 00:25:26.740
Good for me! What do I say and do?

00:25:26.740 --> 00:25:27.860
Bot: Okay boss, let's get those cameras set up already!

00:25:27.860 --> 00:25:29.320
Aw, I want your glasses...

00:25:29.500 --> 00:25:30.900
AWWW I WANT THEM!

00:25:30.900 --> 00:25:32.460
Bot: We need to go, boss.

00:25:32.940 --> 00:25:33.780
Bot: You ready, human?

00:25:33.980 --> 00:25:35.400
Mark: NO!
Bot: Okay, bring in the talent!

00:25:36.040 --> 00:25:37.500
Wait- I thought I WAS the talent!

00:25:37.500 --> 00:25:38.780
Waaaaait a minute.

00:25:39.300 --> 00:25:39.860
Hi!

00:25:40.400 --> 00:25:42.400
Chef: Nice to meet you, human. I'm Chef Bot Ramsay.

00:25:42.400 --> 00:25:43.940
Mark: Oh god.
Chef: Let's get this show rolling, shall we?

00:25:44.160 --> 00:25:44.780
Oh no.

00:25:44.980 --> 00:25:47.400
Mark: Not you!
Bot: Okay, we'll start with the meatballs, team.

00:25:48.140 --> 00:25:49.740
Mark: 'Meatball scene'?
Bot: Aaaaand, action!

00:25:50.160 --> 00:25:52.780
Mark: Wait, what're we doing here?
Chef: Pitiful human, get cooking!

00:25:53.060 --> 00:25:54.860
Chef: These meatballs aren't going to prepare themselves!

00:25:55.140 --> 00:25:57.140
Chef: Is that how you cook for your family at home, human?

00:25:57.340 --> 00:25:59.240
Chef: Disgusting!
Mark: I don't have a family! I'm very lonely!

00:25:59.940 --> 00:26:00.500
Oh!

00:26:00.800 --> 00:26:02.280
Oh, okay! I didn't know tha-

00:26:02.540 --> 00:26:03.080
Oh!

00:26:03.080 --> 00:26:07.720
Chef: Those look so bad, my neural network associates them with literal garbage.

00:26:08.240 --> 00:26:12.140
Mark: Okay!
Chef: So are you going to serve them, or just let them sit there and get even more disgusting?

00:26:12.360 --> 00:26:13.080
I dunno!

00:26:13.500 --> 00:26:15.320
I just like to listen to you ramble!

00:26:15.320 --> 00:26:18.140
Because I know I'm bad, you don't need to tell me I'm bad!

00:26:18.140 --> 00:26:20.980
I'm fully aware of the capacity of my suckage.

00:26:20.980 --> 00:26:24.600
How 'bout this? These look gooood? Question mark?

00:26:24.600 --> 00:26:25.620
Nice and burnt.

00:26:26.500 --> 00:26:27.240
What about this one?

00:26:27.680 --> 00:26:28.680
There we go! Boink!

00:26:28.820 --> 00:26:30.160
Chef: Truly despicable.
Mark: There you go!

00:26:30.440 --> 00:26:35.240
Chef: My kids could cook a meal a hundred times better than that, and they're graphing calculators!

00:26:35.240 --> 00:26:35.740
Bot: Cut!

00:26:35.960 --> 00:26:36.460
Okay!

00:26:36.580 --> 00:26:37.260
Bot: That was good!

00:26:37.600 --> 00:26:38.840
Mark: Good for you!
Chef: Doing great so far, human.

00:26:38.840 --> 00:26:42.040
Chef: I know I can be a little loud on camera, but it's all just part of the show, you know?

00:26:42.040 --> 00:26:46.620
Bot: Alright, scene 2. That's the free-form cooking part.

00:26:46.820 --> 00:26:47.580
Great. Okay.

00:26:47.580 --> 00:26:49.160
Bot: Aaaand, action.

00:26:49.520 --> 00:26:52.520
Mark: I'm just g-
Chef: You worthless, chemical-based meatbag!

00:26:52.660 --> 00:26:56.240
Chef: Get to cooking! Make something good! Show us what you can do with anything!

00:26:56.580 --> 00:27:01.260
Uh, I-I- The only thing I actually learnt how to cook on this show is bacon and eggs.

00:27:01.500 --> 00:27:05.180
And even that was kinda questionable because I'm not pretty sure that I did it well.

00:27:05.180 --> 00:27:06.560
Chef: Hurry up, serve it!

00:27:06.780 --> 00:27:08.060
I-I'm serving it!

00:27:08.440 --> 00:27:10.120
I'm serving it! Bacon and eggs! BAM!

00:27:10.120 --> 00:27:11.120
What everybody wants!

00:27:11.120 --> 00:27:12.700
Bot: It's a wrap, folks!
Mark: It's good stuff!

00:27:14.160 --> 00:27:15.600
Mark: DID I DO GOOD?
Chef: We're good, team.

00:27:15.760 --> 00:27:17.360
Chef: I've got a lot of respect for you after this.

00:27:17.640 --> 00:27:19.000
Mark: Thank you!
Chef: We've got to work together again some time!

00:27:19.000 --> 00:27:21.460
NO! It didn't seem like you were respecting me at all!

00:27:21.460 --> 00:27:23.280
In fact it seemed like you hated me!

00:27:23.280 --> 00:27:25.880
Mark: Ohhh I'm so lonely!
Job Bot: Well, you may head back to the museum if you want to.

00:27:26.100 --> 00:27:28.960
Mark: WOOO!
Job Bot: I'll just be hanging out here while you do whatever you want!

00:27:29.300 --> 00:27:31.540
Ahh, I- I'd rather not stay here, you know.

00:27:31.540 --> 00:27:34.280
I have a normal life that I wanna go out and do things...

00:27:34.640 --> 00:27:36.720
in the real world? And that would be lovely to get to.

00:27:36.720 --> 00:27:38.500
So I'm gonna do that, so,

00:27:38.500 --> 00:27:39.720
I'm outta here, baby.

00:27:39.800 --> 00:27:40.460
Oooh.

00:27:40.960 --> 00:27:42.560
So anyway, this said... [CHOMP]

00:27:42.840 --> 00:27:44.820
'Really?' on it, by the way.

00:27:44.820 --> 00:27:47.680
Some of you caught that, but YES! REALLY.

00:27:47.680 --> 00:27:51.600
OKAY! So that's the end of the chef job simulator.

00:27:51.600 --> 00:27:53.600
I actually used to work in a restaurant a long time ago,

00:27:53.600 --> 00:27:57.180
I probably should've talked about that while I was doing it, but they were- kept talking in my ear!

00:27:57.500 --> 00:27:59.500
But thank you everybody so much for watching,

00:27:59.500 --> 00:28:00.720
I'm gonna do the other ones!

00:28:00.720 --> 00:28:04.980
I'll probably do auto mechanic last because it failed for me last time, and hopefully this didn't FAIL!

00:28:04.980 --> 00:28:06.040
So thanks again.

00:28:06.040 --> 00:28:08.220
And as always, I will see YOU

00:28:08.620 --> 00:28:09.500
